          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "explanation",
          "literal": "Кровавое воскресенье — расстрел мирного шествия рабочих 9 (22) января 1905 года. Оно стало началом Первой русской революции 1905–1907 годов.",
          "literalSHA256": "83475c25fa3d5de831269af4866f81bbc7c65c2f712f8f33a1ca82ca10d55fbd",
          "primaryGround": "PRlib explicitly pairs 9 and 22 January 1905, describes the shooting of the workers procession and says the event began the First Russian Revolution of 1905-1907.",
          "locator": "Bloody Sunday L45-L52",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1605d/source-history-russia56/raw/prlib-bloody-sunday.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note0",
          "literal": "Восстание декабристов произошло в Санкт-Петербурге в декабре 1825 года.",
          "literalSHA256": "279902d1f7b71cfc657757ddfa45900ad59f55dbd973c48c8125ef760a39434e",
          "primaryGround": "PRlib dates the Decembrist armed uprising to December 1825 and locates it in St Petersburg.",
          "locator": "Decembrists L44",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15cdf/source-history-russia6/raw/prlib-decembrist-uprising.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note1",
          "literal": "Рабочие шли с петицией к царю и направлялись к Зимнему дворцу.",
          "literalSHA256": "75e6ed8d42c296c65fec1ed43bc2197db41d61dbe5d67750941bb409fef43604",
          "primaryGround": "PRlib says the workers carried a petition addressed to the Tsar (L45) and were heading for the Winter Palace (L48), an additional own-event fact absent from the prompt and answer label.",
          "locator": "Bloody Sunday L45, L48",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a1605d/source-history-russia56/raw/prlib-bloody-sunday.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note2",
          "literal": "Февральская революция 1917 года привела к падению монархии в России.",
          "literalSHA256": "1577895f408fe8c0a5e0cdc3c31ee74bfec422a8f62fb11e8ed7294a5d45d778",
          "primaryGround": "PRlib records Nicholas II abdication and states that the February Revolution overthrew the autocracy.",
          "locator": "February L59-L60",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a15fba/source-history-russia47-cycle1/raw/prlib-february-new-authorities.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "note3",
          "literal": "Кронштадтское восстание моряков против большевистской власти произошло в 1921 году.",
          "literalSHA256": "52bdf504b25b594c0bb9801b49263a78cdb84e8dc80b68cb0892cdf5ca4fe575",
          "primaryGround": "PRlib states that in March 1921 the Kronstadt garrison and Baltic Fleet crews rose against the Bolsheviks.",
